---
id: handled_moth
title: The Moth Workshop
---
=== bench
A moth of folded brass waits on the workbench. One person can mend it; another can carry it into the garden.
* [Mend the brass moth] { !inventory.moth }
  ~ repair
  -> bench
* [Release the brass moth] { inventory.moth }
  ~ release
  -> garden
* [Try the impossible hinge]
  ~ reject
  -> bench
=== garden
The moth traces a small constellation over the flowers. The workshop remembers who changed its score.
* [Return to the workbench]
  -> bench
